  <!-- ══════════════════ OPEN ══════════════════ -->
  <!--
    Open maps have no walls, so only Scatter, Centerpiece and Ring place
    anything. The vanilla scatter steps (ruins, chunks, erratics) already dress
    the whole field; these sets dress the ENCOUNTER ZONES, so the places where
    groups stand read as places. Voidscape has no set: it is empty as a written
    design choice.
  -->

